n><span class=\\\"amount\\\">*2</span></a></span></p>\"},\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"描述\",\"value\":[\"<p>模仿望宵饼做的新型点心。试图掰下一块，可瞬间整块饼像破损的砖块一样裂成两半，味道更是苦得发涩，像直接把茶叶渣塞进了面团里... 这可千万不要拿到香菱和爱可菲面前...</p>\"]},{\"key\":\"使用效果\",\"value\":[\"<p>队伍中所有角色攻击力提高224点，暴击率提升6%，持续300秒。多人游戏时，仅对自己的角色生效。</p>\"]},{\"key\":\"获得方式\",\"value\":[\"<p>完成7.1版本活动： 银翎溯月，玄鸟结磷 获得。</p>\"]},{\"key\":\"食谱获得\",\"value\":[\"<p>完成烹饪仙茗酥</p>\"]}]}\n", "style": ""}], "id": "128", "is_customize_name": true, "is_abstract": false, "is_show_switch": false, "switch": false, "desc": "", "repeated": false, "is_submodule": false, "origin_module_id": "0", "without_border": false, "can_delete": false, "is_hidden": false, "rich_text_editing": false}, {"name": "", "is_poped": false, "components": [{"component_id": "material_base_info", "layout": "", "data": "{\"name\":\"仙茗酥\",\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/23/75610764/4d119941cb7842a4c1612cc7047d9fd6_7871088787530889180.png\",\"star\":4,\"materials\":{\"key\":\"加工材料\",\"value\":\"<p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"500759\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/31/75610764/adcb94f5bc8614c5c8325bf5f168bc77_3030189556584027851.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"沉玉仙茗\\\" data-entry-amount=\\\"3\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500759/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\" data-updated=\\\"0\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/500759/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/01/31/75610764/adcb94f5bc8614c5c8325bf5f168bc77_3030189556584027851.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">沉玉仙茗</span></span><span class=\\\"amount\\\">*3</span></a></span><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"756\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\